1
00:00:00,625 --> 00:00:01,666
Erase House Carter?

2
00:00:01,916 --> 00:00:03,500
Oh my god, I’m gonna die!

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:07,833
You're just a disowned trash-digger!

4
00:00:08,083 --> 00:00:10,083
Who the hell do you think you are?!

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,041
Thank Gods Count Carter disowned this freak.

6
00:00:22,625 --> 00:00:24,833
Otherwise, the entire legacy of the Carter family

7
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:27,250
would have been dragged into the sewer today.

8
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:31,416
Count Carter has true wisdom.

9
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,000
If this psychotic loser had inherited the title,

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,000
House Carter would have fallen by noon tomorrow.

11
00:00:40,041 --> 00:00:41,625
You pathetic fools.

12
00:00:47,083 --> 00:00:49,083
Can't even recognize a real god 

13
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:51,958
standing in front of you.

14
00:00:52,125 --> 00:00:53,291
Oh, a god?

15
00:00:54,291 --> 00:00:56,750
You’re a dirt-eating miner outcast!

16
00:00:58,041 --> 00:01:01,083
What, are you gonna sprout wings and turn into a dragon?

17
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,083
Freak.

18
00:01:07,041 --> 00:01:08,416
You’ll find out soon enough.

19
00:01:28,583 --> 00:01:30,125
Lord Severin.

20
00:01:30,625 --> 00:01:33,166
The lords and federated kings have crossed the swamps.

21
00:01:33,166 --> 00:01:35,166
They're heading to Emeraldstone for your wedding.

22
00:01:36,166 --> 00:01:37,541
Should I send an Report.

23
00:01:38,291 --> 00:01:39,000
No need.

24
00:01:39,458 --> 00:01:40,458
They’re old acquaintances.

25
00:01:43,416 --> 00:01:44,333
As you command.

26
00:01:45,833 --> 00:01:46,833
Whoa, whoa, wait.

27
00:01:47,666 --> 00:01:50,833
Kings and border lords coming to his wedding?

28
00:01:53,416 --> 00:01:54,583
Did I mishear, 

29
00:01:55,458 --> 00:01:57,541
or has he completely lost his mind?

30
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,333
You heard it right, Lord Redmond!

31
00:02:00,625 --> 00:02:01,625
He’s gone mad!

32
00:02:02,625 --> 00:02:06,416
Next he’ll claim he’s the Godfather of the Sovereign Sanctum!
